(b) If the Commissioner receives a petition under [paragraph (a)(2)](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-12.20#p-12.20(a)(2)) of this section, the Commissioner will—
(1) If it involves any matter subject to section 701(e) of the act or section 4 or 5 of the Fair Packaging and Labeling Act, and meets the requirements for filing, follow the provisions of [§ 10.40 (b)](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-10.40#p-10.40(b)) through [(f)](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-10.40#p-10.40(f));
(2) If it involves a color additive or food additive, and meets the requirements for filing in [§§ 71.1](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-71.1) and [71.2](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-71.2), or in [§§ 171.1](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-171.1), [171.6](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-171.6), [171.7](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-171.7), and [171.100](https://ecfr.gov/current/title-21/section-171.100), publish a notice of filing of the petition within 30 days after the petition is filed instead of a notice of proposed rulemaking.

